      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "How does 2FA stop people from just making a new account? The new account will have a new 2FA and one can easily use an android VM like bluestacks to install the authenticator app.\n\nNot to mention 2FA as implemented is currently OPTIONAL, I still have yet to enable it due to laziness.",
